      <section class="detail-section white">
        <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
        <h2>What SAFE needs to help quickly</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Send the property ZIP code, your role, closing or listing date,
          relevant inspection pages, clear photos, access limitations, and the
          result you need.
        </p>
        <div class="detail-grid">
          <article>
            <h3>Urgent first</h3>
            <p>
              Active leaks, burning odors, exposed wiring, gas odors, sewage,
              major movement, no heat in unsafe weather, and suspected
              structural failure need immediate professional attention.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Protect the transaction</h3>
            <p>
              Separate safety, water, structure, systems, maintenance, and
              cosmetic items so deadlines and decisions stay clear.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Document completion</h3>
            <p>
              Keep the scope, change orders, invoices, permit records, photos,
              model numbers, registrations, and written warranties.
            </p>
